---
/*
  uses.astro — the daily driver setup.

  Lowest priority page on the site. It exists because the toolchain says
  something real about how someone works, and it costs almost nothing to keep
  accurate. Groups render from a local array rather than a shared data module,
  since nothing else on the site needs this list.
*/
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/PageHeader.astro";

const groups = [
  {
    label: "Operating system",
    items: "Arch Linux with Hyprland",
  },
  {
    label: "Editors",
    items: "Neovim day to day, VS Code when a project expects it",
  },
  {
    label: "Languages",
    items: "C, C++, Python, Java, LC-3 assembly, HTML and CSS",
  },
  {
    label: "Embedded",
    items: "ESP-IDF, CMake, LVGL",
  },
  {
    label: "Digital logic",
    items: "Xilinx Vivado, SystemVerilog",
  },
  {
    label: "CAD and 3D",
    items: "Onshape, Fusion 360, Blender",
  },
  {
    label: "Version control",
    items: "Git, with everything on GitHub",
  },
  {
    label: "This site",
    items: "Astro, vanilla CSS, deployed on Cloudflare Pages",
  },
];
---

<Layout
  title="Uses"
  description="The operating system, editor, and toolchain John Jacobson works in day to day."
>
  <PageHeader title="Uses" lead="What I actually work in day to day." />

  <div class="container body">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I run Arch Linux with Hyprland as a daily driver. It needs more
        configuring than a distribution that arrives finished, which is most of
        the reason I run it. I built my first PC in middle school and I have
        never really lost the urge to know what the layer underneath is doing.
      </p>
      <p>
        The embedded work happens on a Waveshare ESP32-P4 development kit driving
        a seven inch DSI touchscreen, built with ESP-IDF and CMake from the
        terminal rather than through an IDE.
      </p>
    </div>

    <dl class="tools">
      {
        groups.map((group) => (
          <div class="tools__row">
            <dt class="tools__label">{group.label}</dt>
            <dd class="tools__items">{group.items}</dd>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </dl>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .body {
    padding-block: var(--space-5) var(--space-6);
  }

  .tools {
    margin: var(--space-6) 0 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .tools__row {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-1);
    padding-block: var(--space-3);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .tools__row:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .tools__row {
      grid-template-columns: 190px 1fr;
      column-gap: var(--space-4);
      align-items: baseline;
    }
  }

  .tools__label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .tools__items {
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
